# What you can use

You have access to `query_oracle(mode, parameters)`. Call
`query_oracle(mode="help", parameters={})` to list the modes and see your
remaining budget.

- `spec` — the complete system definition. Free.
- `run` — run the computation under settings you choose, and return the result.
  Budgeted.
- `help` — modes and remaining budget. Free.

Budgeted runs may be used at most **<N>** times in total.

